Once he woke up, he forgot all about his quest and
went back home.

Unable to get into the castle of Kingdom Anura, Knight
Oscar failed to save Princess Mochi.  She had no choice
but to relinquish control of the Kingdom to the enemies.

Oscar continued to wonder what happened to 
Princess Mochi.
"
